Package: com.yxh41.dyluckybag
Name: Douyin Lucky Bag Helper
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Auto-detect and join Douyin live-stream lucky bags (OCR based)
 Uses on-device screen capture + Vision OCR to find lucky bag prompts and
 tap the join button. No Douyin class hooks, so it survives app updates far
 better than selector-based tweaks.
Maintainer: yxh41
Author: yxh41
Homepage: https://github.com/yxh41/dyluckybag
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit | mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 15.0)
